{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "nav",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Animation｜流程图\n一帧只读语义如何进入 AnimBP；类关系见 [[GGYGO_结构_动画与表现.canvas|结构图]]、[[Animation/结构|结构文档]]。动画曲线另见 [[GGYGO_流程_动画曲线处理.canvas|子图]]。\n普攻目标：[[GGYGO_流程_玩家普攻连段.canvas|连段流程]] · [[计划_玩家普攻连段]]。\n普攻资产：[[Animation/普攻动画实施|契约、调查与验收]]（资产已保存/待接线验收）。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 1740,
      "height": 210,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "source",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "1. CMC / ASC / Pawn 在各自引擎生命周期更新权威状态。\n\n来源接口：CMC::GetResolvedGait/GetWalkRunBlendAlpha/GetStopMotionType/HasMoveInput/GetTurnBackPhase，ASC::HasMatchingGameplayTag，Pawn Transform。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 405,
      "width": 385,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "capture",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "2. AnimInstanceBase 先处理生命周期边界，再捕获一帧 AnimationStateFrame。\n\nInitialize / Uninitialize / Owner 变化共用 Reset；变化帧先清旧状态、绑定当前 Owner，再由 NativeUpdateAnimation → StateCapture::Capture 集中抓取。",
      "x": 470,
      "y": 405,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "read",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "3. ABP_Pyrios 读取输入、步态、WalkRun 混合、停止与转身语义。\n\nAnimBP 经 AnimationStateFrame 和只读查询获得事实；旧拆分引脚由兼容层填充。",
      "x": 970,
      "y": 405,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "transition",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "4. AnimBP 过渡图选择 EnterMove、Moving、Stop、TurnBack 等状态。\n\nAnimBP 过渡规则消费 StateFrame；C++ 不返回具体 ABP 状态名，EnterMove/Stop/TurnBack 选择留在蓝图。",
      "x": 1470,
      "y": 405,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "play",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "5. 状态图选动画序列 / BlendSpace。\n\nGetSeqByKey：EnterMove / Stop / TurnBack 单次播放，Idle 循环。\nGetBlendSpaceByKey(WalkRun)：GaitBlendY → X 轴 WalkRunBlendAlpha（0 Walk / 1 Run）。\n单次段不循环，末尾条件才能稳定退出。",
      "x": 1470,
      "y": 932,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "compat",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "兼容路径：ZZZ 适配旧 Snapshot，不持有 Locomotion 计时。\n\n生命周期 Hook 清 Memory、Snapshot、Events 指针上下文与公开表现字段。每帧再执行 LegacySnapshotAdapter::Capture → MapMovementState：WalkRunBlendAlpha → GaitBlendY；StopMotionType → StopValue 0/1/2。",
      "x": 970,
      "y": 972,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "future",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "待 UE 资产窗口：创建 Locomotion Profile、写入 MovementSet，并回读 ABP/BlendSpace 接线；源码不再反读 AnimInstance。\n[[计划_动画与表现层]]",
      "x": 470,
      "y": 770,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 190,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "combo_entry",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 普攻播放入口（待集成）\nGA 通过 Montage Task 播放本段 Main。\n三份 Montage 已保存并静态回读；ABP Slot 尚未接入。\n[[Animation/普攻动画实施|实际资产与验收范围]] · [[计划_玩家普攻连段|GA 规则]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1430,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "combo_window",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Montage 时间轴（已配置）\n独立 HitWindow / ComboWindow 发 Event.Montage Begin/End。\nGA 校验播放来源并消费请求；运行时待验收。\n01 Combo 结束于115帧，早于116帧 BlendOut；60 fps。",
      "x": 510,
      "y": 1430,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "combo_end",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 未换段 → End（资产已配置）\nMain.NextSectionName=End，End.NextSectionName=None。\nEnd 取素材前30/45/90帧；Combo跨入End 14/18/18帧。\n默认 BlendOut 从116/111/159帧开始，持续15帧（60 fps）。",
      "x": 1020,
      "y": 1430,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "combo_return",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## FullBody BlendOut → 移动（待实测）\nSlot 混回持续更新的 locomotion 源姿势。\n检查 End→Idle/Walk/Run 与中断回移动。\n当前无 Slot；需联合验证 Bip001 修正、独立 Locomotion Profile 与 ABP 接线。",
      "x": 1530,
      "y": 1430,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "bh3_import",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1900,
      "width": 600,
      "height": 260,
      "text": "## BH3 Kevin DemonBattle：独立导入\n模型/StandBy已保存与预览；75条可导入动画全部成功，4条源空片段未生成。\n独立Skeleton，保留原始根层级；渲染按槽名接线。\n[[Animation/BH3_Kevin_DemonBattle导入|导入说明与验收]]\n[[GGYGO_流程_BH3_DemonBattle导入.canvas|导入流程子图]]",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "kevin_combat",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 2300,
      "width": 650,
      "height": 310,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "## Kevin战斗动画（资产待生成）\n55独立Montage；Ice01/02候选窗口；Prop1端点与独立ABP。\n已有资产只读核验，缺失才创建；Movement提供InPlace并执行位移。\n完整链接与3项Animation安全自动化通过；生产资产及玩法待验收。\n[[Animation/资产生产安全|保护契约]] · [[Animation/Kevin战斗动画实施|实施]] · [[GGYGO_流程_Kevin战斗动画.canvas|生成流程]]"
    }
  ],
